# 11ty & HTML Template Standards

## Image Processing (@11ty/eleventy-img)
ALWAYS output images as standard `<img>` elements with explicit fluid `sizes`. The Eleventy HTML transform will auto-convert them into `<picture>` tags with generated AVIF/WebP/JPEG variants during build:

```html
<img
  src="/assets/images/example.jpg"
  alt="Popis obrázku"
  sizes="(max-width: 48rem) 100vw, (max-width: 80rem) 100vw, 96rem"
  class="w-full h-auto object-cover"
>

## Fluid Typography & Spacing
Use our fluid CSS classes from `input.css` instead of fixed breakpoints when appropriate:
- Text: `text-fluid-sm-base`, `text-fluid-lg-2xl`, `text-fluid-2xl-5xl`
- Spacing/Padding: `px-fluid-4-8`, `py-fluid-16-24`, `spacing-fluid-2-4`, `spacing-fluid-4-8`, `spacing-fluid-16-24`

## Nunjucks Patterns
- Use `{% for item in navigation %}` loops for repeated structures.
- Fetch client variables using `{{ client.name }}`, `{{ client.phone }}`, etc., from `src/_data/client.js`.